!XPN explicit proton-neutron format
! depmas=  0.30 lincom=  56 icntrl= 1 fg
! 1=d3/2 2=d5/2 3=s1/2                  
! the first line has the three single-pa
! the - sign tells oxbash that the tbme 
! [18/(16+n)]^0.3 where n is the number 
! Explicit proton-neutron formalism
